addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMOTO, MICHINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHARA, SHUZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAMURA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUZUKI, MINORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAZAKI, YUKINOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A water-dispersible hot-melt composition which comprises (A) 30 to 55 parts by weight of an amorphous poly( alpha -olefin), (B) 3 to 25 parts by weight of a tackifier, (C) 20 to 45 parts by weight of a wax, (D) 2 to 20 parts by weight of a polyolefin resin, and (E) 0 to 15 parts by weight of a compatibilizing agent [the sum of components (A), (B), (C), (D), and (E) is 100 parts by weight]. The hot-melt composition gives a paper having excellent water repellency and excellent moisture resistance.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne une composition thermofusible hydrodispersable constituée (A) pour 30 à 55 parties de sa masse, d'une poly( alpha -oléfine), (B) pour 3 à 25 parties de sa masse, d'un agent donnant du collant, (C) pour 20 à 45 parties de sa masse, d'une cire, (D) pour 2 à 20 parties de sa masse, d'une résine polyoléfinique, et (E) pour 0 à 15 parties de sa masse, d'un agent de compatibilité, la masse des composants (A), (B), (C), (D) et (E) représentant 100 parties de la masse. Cette composition thermofusible donne un papier se distinguant par son hydrofracticité et sa bonne résistance à l'humidité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>